<title>Southern Thailand: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/thailand/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-thailand-2026-10-19T00:17:41.393Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 00:17:41 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent clashes continue in Narathiwat and Yala, with police officers killed in separate attacks and a pipe bomb wounding army officers and security volunteers. Suspects in a Si Sakhon clash were killed, linking the incident to earlier cases. An Israeli tourist was killed in a motorcycle crash in Krabi province and Chinese travelers face kidnapping and job scam warnings from their embassy and travel agencies. Thai Border Force increased patrols along the Myanmar border and a cross-border fiber-optic cable was found linking a house to a Myanmar casino, while an air hostess was implicated in smuggling Chinese nationals across the Thai-Malaysian border. 35 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wto.org/english/news_e/news26_e/trfin_16oct26_517_e.htm&quot;&gt;World Trade Organization&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxNV3Y5RmttVDlnbWNXNEl0QngxcEluVF9kdGtOX0t3dHpURlhaNGVneWt3VDk4aDV0ZmpQQzdsUGZUbGZjQTQ4SWlUVzJlR1QxX3AtWG4xQ3ItMjR1dDNZR25Fdy1Qb3NTX0FaYldPZTZ6elRRcVJwTzJlZ29GRERZemN1Q082YmtDcndIRFJpTXFKdDB5clllNQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bangkok Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPZzVaYjZOcTFFa1FlWG5kT01ZSldjMjFkT015Z0ZMaUJQU2VCSUlvSkxVSEh4aHFTVUkyeHp0VlZIVkptTVk0bjI0RnladFlwcXVqZS1rZGFxOEwxeEthS2YwQlh4UWM1VTZ2ZkNqbU53U1g0aF9uRk9XTmRGb3A5REg1ekJBS0hPWklyaW8xcTM0RHZ3MXJpa2VR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Vietnam.vn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxQUTFleEJZbk8yR240bF9vQ2NMV3dnbUFIZVJhblI4LURMTWdEd2JqUkxyUHFhNXZBRkRjVmtEdnFKWEJVcVBiWlZ3WlhUaGdRLVBEaDJhcHBvbnljZjA1OHZobGRIVDNCa3pIRFc2MUtwMW84czFSN21KdWFWVFhWcVZmd1N4VGgtR2k0aGN6Y1hCSmUzREtSYnlMalpuQnZaYzEyc0pJOU0yZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Roya News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articl